<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - Bankinter 96 net profit seen up 13.7 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Bankinter 96 net profit seen up 13.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for 1996 results of Spanish bank Bankinter. Simple averages of analysts forecasts. In billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>				    1996	  1995	    RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income     36.36	30.91     32.76 - 37.45</p>
<p>    Operating income	  30.66	22.79     29.62 - 32.43</p>
<p>    Net profit		  17.39	15.29     17.00 - 17.65</p>
<p>    EPS (pesetas)	     1,227	 1,078    1,186 - 1,255</p>
<p>Contributors: BBV Interactivos, Argentaria Bolsa, Beta Capital, Benito y Monjardin, Ahorro Corporacion and Renta 4.</p>
<p>Bankinter is expected to announce its results on Tuesday January 21.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
